<title>ITALY: Italian February new car registrations detailed.</title>
<headline>Italian February new car registrations detailed.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian new car registrations in February, by manufacturer and with market share, according to figures issued by the Transport Ministry:</p>
<p>		  Feb 97     Mkt shre   Feb 96   Mkt shre</p>
<p>	     registrations </p>
<p> Fiat	    88,910	44.90    71,592   43.91</p>
<p> Volkswagen    22,220	11.23    18,141   11.13</p>
<p> Ford	    17,760	 8.97    19,192   11.77</p>
<p> General Motors16,560	 8.37    13,787    8.45</p>
<p> PSA Peugeot   14,930	 7.54    10,096    6.19</p>
<p> Renault	 10,960	 5.54     8,938    5.48</p>
<p> BMW		7,260	 3.67     6,092    3.74</p>
<p> Mercedes	 3,070	 1.55     3,294    2.02</p>
<p> Nissan	   4,280	 2.16     3,198    1.96</p>
<p> Volvo	    2,310	 1.17     1,544    0.95</p>
<p>NOTE - Fiat comprises Fiat, Alfa Romeo, Lancia Autobianchi, and Fiat-Innocenti. Volkswagen comprises VW, Audi, Skoda and Seat. General Motors comprises Opel and Saab. PSA-Peugeot comprises Peugeot and Citroen. BMW comprises BMW and Rover.</p>
<p>-- Milan bureau +392 66129502</p>
</text>
